Console PSF2 bitmaps (fonts/console/psf/)
-----------------------------------------
CloudBSD-Latn-8x16.psf and CloudBSD-Piqd-16x16.psf are OFL Modified Versions
rasterized from Noto Sans Mono and pIqaD qolqoS. They do not use Reserved Font
Names. Regenerated by scripts/gen-psf.py. WOFF2 files produced with
woff2_compress are format conversions of the Original Versions (no glyph or
metric edits).

